  "description": "Optional transport-agnostic control facade add-on for Orleans.Lattice runtime per-tree replication configuration. Implements the ILatticeReplicationControl contract over the replication engine's config-authoring seam: an authorized operator can enable replication for a tree (fixing its wire merge mode), disable it, and inspect the runtime replicated-tree set. Authoring is authorized fail-closed through the shared Lattice access gate (default-deny anonymous); the gRPC and MCP transports adapt over this single surface.",
